<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westfield America.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westfield America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of Westfield America Inc as intermediate-term buy and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch was the lead underwriter of Westfield America's May 15 initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 15-1/2.</p>
</text>
